  "claim_boundary": "RootViewQuorum verifies policy-pinned Ed25519 observations from distinct declared organizations over one candidate AssuranceTrustRoot and fresh caller nonce. It corroborates only the views supplied for that challenge and makes authenticated observations of a self-consistent same-version conflict or higher-version root non-outvotable. A passing report is bounded distribution-view evidence, not proof of global freshness or root trust.",
